{"detail": {"templateUuid": "421f9afa8aec496e9302ac843014d4cf", "projectUuid": "c6c1dba84d884596983dd2febac4fca6", "name": "《聚瑞》厝角头有戏出", "description": "屋脊之上，碎瓷成瑞，方寸厝角，藏尽千年风雅✨\n第一次深入了解潮州嵌瓷，真的被这门屋脊上的非遗技艺狠狠震撼。\n作为国家级非物质文化遗产，它不以金玉为材，只以普通瓷片为骨。匠人一敲、一剪、一贴、一砌，将零碎瓷片雕琢成栩栩如生的神将瑞兽，稳稳伫立在潮汕古厝的屋檐之上。\n\n它从来不止是简单的建筑装饰。\n\n日晒雨淋，岁岁伫立，它是潮汕人藏在厝角头的信仰，是守护一方烟火的温柔期盼。\n我循着嵌瓷的古韵与意境，以想象落笔，虚构了这场屋脊之上神话故事。\n\n潮州嵌瓷，不碎，不立。\n碎，是历经磨砺的肉身；聚，是浴火重生的涅槃。\n这独属于潮汕的浪漫与震撼，一定要亲身奔赴，亲眼感受。", "coverUrl": "/assets/ed1ac2f5c928f0e0.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/32cc5c466a28456e97c20dbafd702f7e/556c38d72ccd3f912714937db60ba38f9a4fb16e.mp4", "snapshotId": 25391, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 1537910, "ownerUuid": "32cc5c466a28456e97c20dbafd702f7e", "avatar": "/assets/6b50549408259db1.webp", "nickname": "TOTOO", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 8, "tags": [{"id": 3040, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "广告导演请就位", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3043, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "3-非遗创生", "parentTag": 3040, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/3043", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "http://xhslink.com/o/8YV9htSUO5u  https://v.douyin.com/3nm-Ukm8it8/", "createAt": "2026年07月08日 23:18", "updateAt": "2026年07月10日 22:01", "publishAt": "2026年07月08日 23:18", "playCount": 1, "viewCreationProcessCount": 0, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/421f9afa8aec496e9302ac843014d4cf.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 177, "edges": 141}}, "recommendList": []}